"same-project-authority\",\n  \"task_resolution\": {\n    \"schema_version\": 1,\n    \"identity\": {\n      \"project_id\": \"proj.pose-dist\",\n      \"kind\": \"spec\",\n      \"slug\": \"pose-governance-git-reads-untranslated\"\n    },\n    \"resolved\": true,\n    \"resolution_state\": \"resolved\",\n    \"status\": \"in-progress\",\n    \"source_revision\": \"acb136cbfdcfbdb8e424f0f709418dea0d187937\",\n    \"source_digest\": \"e80de9d3f1f0f5057aacda2621c2f1b50ab7fe273faa9b403378d91e73ca7e73\"\n  },\n  \"authority_revision\": \"acb136cbfdcfbdb8e424f0f709418dea0d187937\",\n  \"supported_contracts\": [\n    \"qualified-artifact-refs@1\",\n    \"spec-authority-transfer@1\",\n    \"federated-roadmap-acceptance@1\"\n  ],\n  \"context_revision\": \"bc1c5bb5c17dfc7b6aee4e5cee5fc35e212b3c770deff19858f366bae130f3da\"\n}\n# POSE trail — review\n\nAvaliação técnica de PR/diff: escopo, contratos, segurança, validação.\n- Path:      pose-mcp → domain: backend-go (repo-map)\n- Workflow:  .pose/workflows/review.md\n- Skill:     pose-review\n- Rules:     .pose/rules/security.md, .pose/rules/documentation-style.md, .pose/rules/backend-go.md\n- Spec:      false\n- ADR:       false\n- Knowledge: consume=true, produce=handoff (quando aceitar risco residual ou condicionar merge)\n- Validation: exigir evidência de pose validate do implementador\nacb136cbfdcfbdb8e424f0f709418dea0d187937 chore: regenerate indexes after the validation record\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
